WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.180
A review can involve seven independent agents

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.750
without turning your workspace into seven conversations
to manage.

3
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.460
Open the workflow to see the review as one step.

4
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.700
Open Agents to meet the specialists.

5
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:15.000
Each has its own saved session, assignment, and result.

6
00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.930
Documents stay attached to the step that produced them,

7
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.300
so you can trace a finding back to its source.

8
00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:22.620
First Mate brings those findings together.

9
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.270
You inspect the evidence, make the decision, and shape
the next part of the workflow.
